ion cannot be undone.\\\" appeared; confirming showed toast \\\"Listing deleted\\\" and the listing immediately disappeared from My Listings (empty state shown).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created listing \\\"FT4 Sold Item Test\\\" (prod-1787576119034), verified it appeared in Browse (11→ items) and matched search. Clicked \\\"Mark Sold\\\" on My Listings (in-app, no reload) - toast \\\"Item marked as sold\\\", status changed to \\\"Sold\\\". Re-checked Browse: count dropped to 10 items, listing no longer shown. Searched for exact title: \\\"No items found\\\". Viewed product detail page directly via My Listings > View: page displays \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" with no Add to Cart/Buy/Request button present - only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" button shown.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered with name, email, password (11 chars), location; toast \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" shown; header changed to show \\\"Tim QA\\\" and Sell button, confirming signed-in state.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On Browse page (10 items available), typed \\\"Lamp\\\" into the search box. Results updated live to \\\"1 items available\\\" showing only the matching \\\"Vintage Brass Floor Lamp\\\" listing; all non-matching items were correctly excluded.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On Browse page, checked the \\\"Electronics\\\" category filter checkbox. Results updated live to \\\"1 items available\\\" showing only \\\"Sony Noise-Canceling Headphones\\\" (category Electronics); all other categories' items were excluded. Checkbox showed checked state and \\\"Clear all filters\\\" control appeared.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": 