page (10 items), checked the \\\"Good\\\" Condition filter checkbox. Results updated live to \\\"3 items available\\\" - Yoga Mat & Blocks Set, Vintage Denim Jacket, Complete Harry Potter Book Set - all three correctly display \\\"Good\\\" condition badge; no items of other conditions (New, Like New, Fair, Worn) were included.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On Browse page, changed sort dropdown from \\\"Newest First\\\" to \\\"Price: Low to High\\\". Listing order updated correctly to strictly ascending price: $35, $45, $55, $65, $95, $125, $175, $180, $285, $320 (Kids Wooden Train Set → Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On product detail page for \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\" ($65, in-stock/active listing), clicked \\\"Add to Cart\\\". Toast \\\"Added to cart!\\\" appeared, and the header cart icon updated from no badge to showing count \\\"1\\\", confirming the item was successfully added to the cart.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigated to Cart page (in-app via cart icon): showed \\\"1 item\\\", correct listing (Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M, $65), correct total \\\"$65.00\\\", and \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" button. Clicked it: toast \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" appeared, cart updated to \\\"0 items\\\" with empty-cart state (\\\"Your cart is empty / Find something you love!\\\"), and header cart badge count was removed, confirming the purchase request flow completed successfully end-to-end.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with unregistered email \\\"nonexistent.user.qa@example.com\\\" showed toast \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", remained on /login page, header still unauthenticated (no session created).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered qatester2@example.com successfully, then (without reloading, via in-app navigation) attempted to register again as QATESTER2@example.com (case-variant) with a different name/password/location. The app rejected it with toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\", remained on /register, and did not sign in or replace the original account. (Note: an earlier attempt of this test was invalidated by an accidental full-page reload that reset the app's in-memory data before the duplicate attempt; this retest without reload gives the correct result.)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password not verified; any password accepted for existing account\", \"actual\": \"Registered account qatester3@example.com with password \\\"correctpass1\\\", logged out via in-app menu (no reload), then attempted sign-in with a deliberately wrong password \\\"wrongpassword\\\". Login succeeded (toast \\\"Welcome back!\\\", session established as \\\"QA Tester Three\\\") instead of being rejected. Confirms password is not actually verified.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /register form: (1) submitting completely empty form triggered native \\\"Please fill out this field\\\" validation on all 4 required inputs (Full Name, Email, Password, Location), blocking submission - confirmed via DOM required=true on all fields. (2) Filled name/location validly but entered invalid email \\\"not-an-email\\\" and 1-character password \\\"a\\\": form remained on /register (no account created), and DOM validation confirmed email field invalid with message \\\"Please include an '@' in the email address\\\" and password field invalid with message \\\"Please lengthen this text to 6 characters or more\\\" (minLength=6 attribute enforced). Constraints correctly block registration with invalid/incomplete data.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the Create Listing form completely empty focused the first invalid required field (native \\\"Please fill out this field\\\" validation on Title; required also enforced on Description, Price, Location). Submitting with title/description/price/category/condition/location filled but no photo produced explicit toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\" and blocked creation. Category/condition selects are also required (native select elements). Missing information is clearly identified to the seller in each case.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is a native number input with min=0; entering \\\"-25\\\" and submitting kept the form on /create-listing with no listing created, and DOM check confirmed validationMessage \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\" Attempting to type non-numeric text \\\"abc\\\" into the price field was natively rejected by the browser (Cannot type text into input[type=number]). Submitting a valid non-negative price (19.99) succeeded and created the listing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged in as the owner (QA Tester Three) of an active listing (\\\"FT4 Sold Item Test\\\", re-marked Active via My Listings), then viewed its own product detail page. Unlike third-party listings (which show \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\"), the seller's own listing page only shows a \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" button - no Add to Cart / Buy / Message Seller controls are exposed, correctly preventing a seller from purchasing or messaging themselves about their own item.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempting to register with an already-used email (case-variant QATESTER2@example.com) immediately showed toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\" and kept the registration form populated and available for correction on the same /register page, without navigating away.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On the homepage \\\"Shop by Category\\\" section, clicked the \\\"Furniture\\\" quick-filter button. Without a page reload, the Browse section updated: item count changed to \\\"3 items available\\\" (Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf, Upcycled Pallet Coffee Table, Mid-Century Modern Armchair - all Furniture), and the \\\"Furniture\\\" checkbox in the Categories filter panel automatically became checked, staying in sync with the quick-filter button, and a \\\"Clear all filters\\\" control appeared.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Cart had 2 items (Sony Headphones $180, Yoga Mat $55, total $235.00). Clicked the trash/remove icon on the Sony Headphones line item. Toast \\\"Removed from cart\\\" appeared, the item was immediately removed from the list, item count text updated from \\\"2 items\\\" to \\\"1 item\\\", the total recalculated correctly to \\\"$55.00\\\" (remaining item only), and the header cart badge decremented from \\\"2\\\" to \\\"1\\\" - all in-app without a page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On product detail page for \\\"Yoga Mat & Blocks Set\\\", clicked \\\"Message Seller\\\" - a modal dialog \\\"Send a message to Sofia Martinez\\\" opened with a textbox and a \\\"Send Message\\\" button that was correctly disabled while the textbox was empty. Typed a message; Send Message button became enabled. Clicked Send Message: dialog closed, toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" appeared, confirming the messaging interaction works end-to-end with proper empty-state disable/enable behavior.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigated to /about via in-app \\\"About\\\" nav link. Page displays complete, non-placeholder content: mission heading/paragraph, three value-proposition sections (Reduce Waste, Support Local, Think Global) each with icon, heading, and descriptive paragraph text, and a closing CTA section (\\\"Ready to make a difference?\\\") with a \\\"Start Browsing\\\" link. No lorem-ipsum, broken text, or missing sections were found. Clicked \\\"Start Browsing\\\" and it correctly navigated in-app back to the Browse page, confirming the content and its CTA are both accurate and functional.\"}]}"
